      <h2><span class="num">01</span> Information We Collect</h2>

      <h3>When You Contact Us</h3>

      <p>If you fill out the contact form, we may collect:</p>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>Full Name</strong> – so we know who we're talking to.</li>
        <li><strong>Email Address</strong> – to reply to your message.</li>
