        <li><strong>Subject</strong> – optional topic of your message.</li>
        <li><strong>Message</strong> – the information you send to us.</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        This information is stored securely in MongoDB Atlas and is only accessible by the website owner.
      </p>

      <h3>When You Visit the Website</h3>

      <p>We automatically collect some basic visitor information, such as:</p>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>IP Address</strong> – used to identify your approximate location.</li>
        <li><strong>City, Region and Country</strong> – determined from your IP address using <code>ip-api.com</code>.</li>
        <li><strong>Browser</strong> – such as Chrome, Firefox, Edge, or Safari.</li>
        <li><strong>Device Type</strong> – Desktop, Mobile, or Tablet.</li>
        <li><strong>Visited Page</strong> – the page you opened on the website.</li>
        <li><strong>Date & Time</strong> – when you visited the website.</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        We do <strong>not</strong> use cookies, browser fingerprinting, or any kind of cross-site tracking.
      </p>

      <h3>Resume Downloads</h3>

      <p>
        If you download the resume, we only increase a download counter.
        We do not store any personal information about who downloaded it.
      </p>
